<view class="page team-page">
  <view class="kicker">TEAM · GENTLE TOGETHER</view><view class="title">和重要的人，<text class="line-break">一起慢慢来</text></view><view class="subtitle">只有你主动加入的队伍才会显示；成员只看到你选择分享的打卡进度。</view>
  <view class="top-actions"><button class="join-btn" data-mode="join" bindtap="setPanel"><text>＋</text> 加入队伍</button><button class="create-btn" data-mode="create" bindtap="setPanel"><text>♡</text> 创建队伍</button></view>
  <view class="team-hero"><image class="team-hero-image" src="/assets/team-tutu-banner.png" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="team-hero-wash"></view><view class="team-hero-copy"><view class="hero-title">一起打卡，<text class="line-break">不比较，只陪伴</text></view><view class="hero-subtitle">看看彼此今天走了多远，为每一个完成和重新开始留一点温柔的空间。</view><view class="hero-actions"><button class="hero-main" data-mode="join" bindtap="setPanel">输入邀请码</button><button class="hero-ghost" bindtap="goCheckin">完成今天的打卡</button></view></view></view>
  <view class="cloud-error" wx:if="{{cloudError}}">{{cloudError}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view>
  <view class="card action-card" wx:if="{{activePanel}}"><view class="between"><view class="section-title">{{activePanel === 'create' ? '创建一支温柔小队' : '加入朋友的队伍'}}</view><button class="text-btn close-btn" bindtap="closePanel">关闭</button></view><block wx:if="{{activePanel === 'create'}}"><input class="input" value="{{teamName}}" bindinput="setName" placeholder="给小队取个名字"/><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="createTeam">确认创建</button></block><block wx:else><input class="input" value="{{inviteCode}}" bindinput="setCode" placeholder="输入真实邀请码"/><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="joinTeam">确认加入</button></block></view>
  <view class="card empty-team" wx:if="{{!loading && !teams.length && !cloudError}}"><view class="empty-team-art">♡</view><view class="section-title">还没有加入任何队伍</view><view class="muted">创建自己的小队，或让朋友发来邀请码。这里不会再自动显示演示队伍。</view><button class="primary-btn" data-mode="create" bindtap="setPanel">创建第一支队伍</button></view>
  <view class="card team" wx:for="{{teams}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="team"><view class="between"><view><view class="section-title">{{team.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{team.members.length}} 位成员 · {{team.sharingCount}} 人分享今日进度</view></view><view class="team-icon">♡</view></view><view class="summary"><text>{{team.completedCount}}</text> 项任务已共同完成</view><view class="member" wx:for="{{team.members}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="member"><image wx:if="{{member.avatarUrl}}" class="member-avatar" src="{{member.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="member-avatar">{{member.initial}}</view><view class="member-copy"><view>{{member.displayName}}</view><text>{{member.progressText}}</text></view></view><view class="share-row"><view><view>向队友分享今日完成数</view><text>开关仅对当前队伍有效</text></view><switch checked="{{team.mySharing}}" color="#df7370" data-id="{{team.id}}" bindchange="toggleSharing" /></view><view class="invite between"><view><text>邀请码</text><text class="invite-code">{{team.inviteCode}}</text></view><button class="text-btn" data-code="{{team.inviteCode}}" bindtap="copyCode">复制</button></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="section-title small">留一句温柔鼓励</view><textarea class="textarea encouragement" maxlength="200" value="{{draftByTeam[team.id]}}" data-id="{{team.id}}" bindinput="setDraft" placeholder="写给一起努力的人…"/><button class="primary-btn send" data-id="{{team.id}}" bindtap="saveEncouragement">{{team.ownEncouragement ? '保存修改' : '发送鼓励'}}</button><view class="messages" wx:if="{{team.encouragements.length}}"><view class="muted">队伍里的留言</view><view class="message" wx:for="{{team.encouragements}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="message"><text>{{message.author}}</text><view>“{{message.content}}”</view></view></view></view>
</view>
